#! seed 1861
#! files cws1.sav
# Civil War Strategy: a saved game knows its map. A new game on the Alternate Map is saved to cws1.sav.
# Files, New Game, and Start NEW Game on the Standard Map. Then Files, Load: cws1.sav brings the Alternate
# Map back with it. Files, Quit, Yes. cws1.sav is checked after the run: its first line names the scenario.

# The title menu: Start NEW Game; the scenario menu: the Alternate Map.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
play until 2:S
text a
# March 1861, on the Alternate Map. Files: Save, to cws1.sav.
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text s
prompt
key enter
# Files: New Game, to the title menu: Start NEW Game; the scenario menu: the Standard Map.
prompt
text f
prompt
text n
play until 2:V
text s
play until 2:S
text s
# March 1861, on the Standard Map. Files: Load, cws1.sav.
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text l
prompt
key enter
# The saved game, on the Alternate Map again. Files: Quit, Yes; END's key.
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
